00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:40.620
Kiva, the infamous rapper who refused to halt his attacks on DMC, received retribution...

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:41.120
Your fucking existence alone is sacrilege towards DMC!

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.120
